            {
                "entry_id": "665b27ab-8380-3160-b3cf-9113d48a448b",
                "word": "impropriété",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "89a4d9a5-0a19-4139-841a-cebe200cbaa7",
                        "entry_id": "665b27ab-8380-3160-b3cf-9113d48a448b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "impropriétés"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46784ea1-3903-3ca8-94a9-fac3c59cb285",
                        "entry_id": "665b27ab-8380-3160-b3cf-9113d48a448b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualité de ce qui est impropre, en parlant du langage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "12b9e5fd-41b7-4849-983a-c54c3bc5a089",
                                "sense_id": "46784ea1-3903-3ca8-94a9-fac3c59cb285",
                                "text": "L’impropriété de ses expressions rend son style obscur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e441983e-0629-41c4-a033-74cadd58d51b",
                                "sense_id": "46784ea1-3903-3ca8-94a9-fac3c59cb285",
                                "text": "– Je me suis, en effet, rendu compte, dit ma grand'mère, de l'impropriété de beaucoup de mots. De presque tous les mots, ajouta-t-elle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0f76979-70a0-48de-91ba-1c5437c402c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "665b27ab-8380-3160-b3cf-9113d48a448b",
                        "source_sense_id": "46784ea1-3903-3ca8-94a9-fac3c59cb285",
                        "target_lang_word": "impropriety",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impropriety",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87bce44c-e7f8-39de-a8a9-d50bf0ff6da3",
                                        "entry_id": "1b3b38fb-18e4-32bd-953b-627e59abac95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being improper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5317df4-9d42-47ca-95fc-bcb6fc2f17f2",
                                                "sense_id": "87bce44c-e7f8-39de-a8a9-d50bf0ff6da3",
                                                "text": "If so many ladies of rank wrote books, there could be no impropriety in her following their example,..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66811b67-603e-4a2f-9fe4-4d3119654a10",
                                                "sense_id": "87bce44c-e7f8-39de-a8a9-d50bf0ff6da3",
                                                "text": "To see the impropriety of this noninformative prior, note that the posterior results (2.19)–(2.22) can be justified by as [sic] combining the likelihood function with the following ‘prior density’: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bc27161-504a-3501-91c0-8d839f86d7db",
                                        "entry_id": "1b3b38fb-18e4-32bd-953b-627e59abac95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An improper act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c6357bc-a8d3-477c-9b4e-0c07f94f6a12",
                                                "sense_id": "7bc27161-504a-3501-91c0-8d839f86d7db",
                                                "text": "Bayh and his supporters ended up maintaining that it was no longer sufficient that a nominee had not engaged in any impropriety; now there must be no \"appearance\" of impropriety. Thus opponents of a nominee could raise an \"appearance\" of impropriety by false charges and thereby defeat him. It was a vicious circle: the nominee would not be condemned for what he had done but for what he had been accused of having done by his detractors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0176a271-9bbb-3619-811a-6e828e0e898f",
                                        "entry_id": "1b3b38fb-18e4-32bd-953b-627e59abac95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Improper language."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "756849c3-8fec-418c-8b82-5b4fbc93c550",
                        "source_entry_id": "665b27ab-8380-3160-b3cf-9113d48a448b",
                        "source_sense_id": "46784ea1-3903-3ca8-94a9-fac3c59cb285",
                        "target_lang_word": "malapropism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "malapropism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00e9b674-2d72-33de-bf45-f72b425175a2",
                                        "entry_id": "5bbe0604-b98b-3c66-b55c-6fa4f22e564a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The blundering use of an absurdly inappropriate word or expression in place of a similar-sounding one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "926a358b-b7c8-48b6-ba1c-6826927c280e",
                                                "sense_id": "00e9b674-2d72-33de-bf45-f72b425175a2",
                                                "text": "The script employed malapropism to great effect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38085299-d06c-3bd1-b610-70741ea672ff",
                                        "entry_id": "5bbe0604-b98b-3c66-b55c-6fa4f22e564a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of this; malaprop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cda4fac-6d3a-4cc5-b466-6cffdd2497e7",
                                                "sense_id": "38085299-d06c-3bd1-b610-70741ea672ff",
                                                "text": "The translator matched every malapropism in the original with one from his own language."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29f519fe-60b6-443c-93d8-55c9435e35c2",
                                                "sense_id": "38085299-d06c-3bd1-b610-70741ea672ff",
                                                "text": "The humor comes from all the malapropisms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
